<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait's Gulf Bank 1H net up.</title>
<headline>Kuwait's Gulf Bank 1H net up.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-07-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>			  (Million of dinars unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1997			 1996</p>
<p> Net profit		    18.42			15.29</p>
<p> Operating costs		6.66			 5.57</p>
<p> Net banking income	  25.08			20.86</p>
<p> Interest income	     52.81			47.27</p>
<p> Loans and advances	 595.91		     433.15</p>
<p> Government debt bonds    321.56			409.47</p>
<p> Total assets		1,625			 1,393</p>
<p>Full name: The Gulf Bank KSC.</p>
<p>Note - The 1H bank results were published in a paid advertisement in a local newspaper.</p>
<p>- Kuwait newsroom, +965 240 8945</p>
